          "value": "\n<ol><li>\n<p>God is sufficient for us, and he is the best disposer.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Muhammad ibn Abi\u0304 Bakr [?] ibn Yu\u0304suf [?]</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>bore witness to the [fe- male] transferer of property and the recipient of it mentioned</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>above, with what has been attributed to the two of them above, on this date. </p>\n</li></ol>\n",
